      "id": "claim_be503ffca56e48b4b9112f9cf64a66a3",
      "statement": "The tool learns product codes through three descending strengths of signals: exact token rules (batch-wide, strongest), neighbour context (advisory suggestions), and token shape similarity (advisory suggestions based on normalized patterns).",
