        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_71382c5590ab4f8e824e0a41ce408729",
      "statement": "Only taught rows (rows the user has explicitly modified, confirmed, or edited) contribute to learning; untouched rows and the tool's own pre-selections never teach, preventing bad defaults from entrencing themselves.",
